{"id":"1ee2b593ec05b4c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-prikry-sequence.md","title":"Prikry Sequence","display":"df-prikry-sequence — Prikry Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prikry-sequence","aliases":["58-df-prikry-sequence"],"display":"df-prikry-sequence — Prikry Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prikry-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prikry-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prikry-sequence — Prikry Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" href=\"?note=a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md\">../batch15/58-df-prikry.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c8f804f98505ae8\" href=\"?note=6c8f804f98505ae8\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md\">../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U,G,c_G\\in V,\\quad G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U\">\\(\\kappa,U,G,c_G\\in V,\\quad G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" href=\"?note=a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md\">../batch15/58-df-prikry.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c8f804f98505ae8\" href=\"?note=6c8f804f98505ae8\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md\">../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S(c_G,\\kappa,U,G) \\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}_U\\land\nc_G=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup G:\\exists A\\in U\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(c_G,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(c_G),\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S(c_G,\\kappa,U,G) \\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}_U\\land\nc_G=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup G:\\exists A\\in U\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(c_G,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(c_G),\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Prikry forcing changes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> while adding a Prikry sequence.</li>\n<li>The sequence determines the new cofinalities.</li>\n<li>The sequence is defined only through the four-place predicate; a bare equation for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_G\">\\(c_G\\)</span> would leave <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> as hidden free parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6ccd6f7d977ed72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c8f804f98505ae8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6ccd6f7d977ed72","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa,U,G,c_G\\in V,\\quad G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c8f804f98505ae8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-cofinal.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,U,G,c_G\\in V,\\quad G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrikrySequence}_S(c_G,\\kappa,U,G) \\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathbb{P}_U\\land\nc_G=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup G:\\exists A\\in U\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(c_G,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cofinal}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(c_G),\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c_G","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1288,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-979","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-prikry-sequence.md|58-df-prikry-sequence]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a6ccd6f7d977ed72","6c8f804f98505ae8","36d7463d215be751"]}